            "value": "Phase Wake: MIT License, © r1adBE.\nManrope ఫాంట్: SIL Open Font License 1.1, © The Manrope Project Authors.\nధ్వని గుర్తింపు: Apple వారి SoundAnalysis, iOSలో అంతర్నిర్మితం.\nధ్వనులు: opengameart.org నుంచి ఉచిత రికార్డింగ్‌లు (CC0)"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Phase Wake: สัญญาอนุญาต MIT © r1adBE\nฟอนต์ Manrope: SIL Open Font License 1.1 © The Manrope Project Authors\nการตรวจจับเสียง: SoundAnalysis ของ Apple ซึ่งมีอยู่ใน iOS\nเสียง: การบันทึกเสียงเสรี (CC0) จาก opengameart.org"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Phase Wake: MIT Lisansı, © r1adBE.\nManrope yazı tipi: SIL Open Font License 1.1, © The Manrope Project Authors.\nSes algılama: Apple SoundAnalysis, iOS içinde yerleşik.\nSesler: opengameart.org’dan özgür kayıtlar (CC0)"
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Phase Wake: ліцензія MIT, © r1adBE.\nШрифт Manrope: SIL Open Font License 1.1, © The Manrope Project Authors.\nРозпізнавання звуків: SoundAnalysis від Apple, вбудовано в iOS.\nЗвуки: вільні записи (CC0) з opengameart.org"
          }
        },
        "ur": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Phase Wake: MIT لائسنس، © r1adBE۔\nManrope فونٹ: SIL Open Font License 1.1، © The Manrope Project Authors۔\nآواز کی پہچان: Apple کا SoundAnalysis، iOS میں شامل۔\nآوازیں: opengameart.org کی مفت ریکارڈنگز (CC0)"
